      <p begin="02:15.750" end="02:18.100" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause either way we both lyin' more than half of the time</p>
      <p begin="02:18.100" end="02:20.410" ttm:agent="v1">Except for when I'm home workin' on your graphic design</p>
      <p begin="02:20.410" end="02:22.740" ttm:agent="v1">Every time we see each other, I'm takin' you home</p>
